{"words": [{"text": "يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا", "translation": "O you"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believe[d]"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(Do) not"}, {"text": "تَقُولُوا۟", "translation": "say"}, {"text": "رَٰعِنَا", "translation": "Raina"}, {"text": "وَقُولُوا۟", "translation": "and say"}, {"text": "ٱنظُرْنَا", "translation": "Unzurna"}, {"text": "وَٱسْمَعُوا۟ ۗ", "translation": "and listen"}, {"text": "وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "And for the disbelievers"}, {"text": "عَذَابٌ", "translation": "(is) a punishment"}, {"text": "أَلِيمٌۭ", "translation": "painful"}], "sahih": "O you who have believed, say not [to Allāh's Messenger], \"Rāʿinā\" but say, \"Unẓurnā\"1 and listen. And for the disbelievers is a painful punishment."}